	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Focus and attention</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Your ability to focus your attention is a double edged sword - it allows some pretty incredible feats, but it blinds you to so much as well. </p>
